        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-transfer-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe transfer to a recipient",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "After a transfer verb, 给 introduces the recipient before the transferred thing. Distinguish this from 给 as the main verb give.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我送给他一本书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ sòng gěi tā yī běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I give him a book as a gift.",
                "audio": "6e13bb73ec396d94c9f448143942f56609e3faee9a2f6970ad4fa593bb6289ea"
              },
              {
                "text": "他送给我两本书。",
                "pinyin": "tā sòng gěi wǒ liǎng běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "He gives me two books as gifts.",
                "audio": "052ed3a59750322330c3a33616f342cd2ddda185371bbfe9623c3162704fe2d9"
              }
            ]
          },
